name: fraud_dealer
title: "Dealer activations runbook"
summary: "Detects: activations by one dealer with no originated traffic up to `traffic_grace_hours` (default 48) after the window, above `threshold` (default 20)."
steps[5]:
  - text: "Detects: activations by one dealer with no originated traffic up to `traffic_grace_hours` (default 48) after the window, above `threshold` (default 20)."
    link:
      kind: dataset
      id: fraud_dealer
  - text: "Check: the dealer's commission claims against those lines; the identity documents used."
  - text: "Act: hold the dealer's commission; audit the dealer."
  - text: "Silent by design: a busy dealer whose lines are used; late-day activations whose lines are first used the next morning."
  - text: "Known false-positive source (no defence here): a dealer selling prepaid stock that buyers activate but use later than the grace period."
ownerRole: fraud-analyst
tags[2]: fraud, telco
